  "details": "it seems to be the most proper place for this report...\n\nafter a song finishes playing:\n\n1. with the default setting of shuffle/random on, repeat off, the player repeats the same song again.\n\n2. with repeat on (shuffle on or off), the song just stops after playing once, and the player semi stops working - it shows the \"pause\" button instead of \"play\" (which either way  doesn't work) and requires changing the song, or toggling repeat to off, for the same song to start playing again.\n\n3. with random off, repeat off - the song changes, but incorrectly to a random other song\n\n(by \"on\" i mean the button is darkened)",
